--
libc++ (LLVM 18) <sstream>: converting `o << "ab"' drops the __format
functions (root cause
cpp20_requires_expression_parameter_pack_of_differing_types).  The drops of
basic_streambuf<wchar_t, char_traits<char>>::xsgetn / xsputn, a bogus
instance (cpp_deduction_failure_does_not_instantiate_pattern), are fixed.
clang++ 18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
